#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:42
msgid "Move the underlying grid."
msgstr "Beweeg die onderliggende rooster."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:48
msgid "Click anywhere on the screen to draw a point."
msgstr "Kliek orals op die skerm na teken 'n punt."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Click anywhere to draw a segment between two points. New points will be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Kliek orals na teken 'n segment tussen twee punte. Nuwe punte sal wees "
"geskep."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:56
msgid "Click anywhere to draw a line through two points. New points will be created."
msgstr "Kliek orals na teken 'n lyn deur twee punte. Nuwe punte sal wees geskep."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:60
msgid "Click on a line or a circle to draw a point on that object."
msgstr "Kliek op 'n lyn of 'n sirkel na teken 'n punt op wat voorwerp."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:64
msgid "Click on two lines to draw the point of concurrency."
msgstr ""

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:68
msgid "Click on any two points to draw the bisection of them."
msgstr ""

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:72
msgid "Click on a point you want to mirror and then on another point or a line."
msgstr "Kliek op 'n punt jy wil hê na spieël en dan word op nog 'n punt of 'n lyn."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:76
msgid "Click anywhere to draw a triangle. New points will be created."
msgstr "Kliek orals na teken 'n driehoek. Nuwe punte sal wees geskep."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:80
msgid ""
"First, click on the center point of the circle and then on another to "
"determine the radius."
msgstr ""
"Eerste, kliek op die sentrum punt van die sirkel en dan word op nog 'n na "
"bepaal die radius."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:84
msgid "First, click on the center point. You will then be asked to enter diameter."
msgstr ""

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:88
msgid "Click on three points to draw an arc."
msgstr "Kliek op drie punte na teken 'n boog."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:92
msgid ""
"Click anywhere to draw a vector from the first to the second. New points "
"will be created."
msgstr ""
"Kliek orals na teken 'n vektor van die eerste na die tweede. Nuwe punte sal "
"wees geskep."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:96
msgid ""
"Click anywhere to draw a ray from the first through the second. New points "
"will be created."
msgstr ""
"Kliek orals na teken 'n straal van die eerste deur die tweede. Nuwe punte "
"sal wees geskep."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:100
msgid "Click on a line and then on a point through which the parallel line will run."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op 'n lyn en dan word op 'n punt deur wat die parallelle lyn sal "
"hardloop."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:104
msgid ""
"Click on a line and then on a point through which the perpendicular line "
"will run."
msgstr ""

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:108
msgid ""
"First, click on the point to move and then on a vector to define the "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"Eerste, kliek op die punt na beweeg en dan word op 'n vektor na definieer "
"die beweging."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:112
msgid ""
"Click on the point to rotate, then on the center of the rotation and then on "
"an arc to define the rotation."
msgstr ""
"Kliek op die punt na roteer, dan word op die sentrum van die rotering en dan "
"word op 'n boog na definieer die rotering."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:116
msgid "Click on any object to delete it and all of its child objects."
msgstr "Kliek op enige voorwerp na uitvee dit en alle van sy kind objekte."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:120
msgid "Click on a point and then on a line or circle to attach this point."
msgstr "Kliek op 'n punt en dan word op 'n lyn of sirkel na aanheg hierdie punt."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:124
msgid "Click on a point to turn its trace mode on, or, if it is on, to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:128
msgid "Click anywhere to add a text field at that spot."
msgstr "Kliek orals na voeg by 'n teks veld na wat spot."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:132
msgid "Click on any two point to measure its distance."
msgstr "Kliek op enige twee punt na meet sy afstand."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:136
msgid "Click on an arc to measure the angle."
msgstr "Kliek op 'n boog na meet die hoek."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:140
msgid "Click on a circle to measure its area."
msgstr "Kliek op 'n sirkel na meet sy area."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:144
msgid "Click on any two points to measure the slope between them."
msgstr ""

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:148
msgid "Click on a circle to measure its circumference."
msgstr ""

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:154
msgid "Click on any object to apply current draw color"
msgstr "Kliek op enige voorwerp na wend aan huidige teken kleur"

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:161
msgid "Click on any object to apply current size."
msgstr "Kliek op enige voorwerp na wend aan huidige grootte."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:178
msgid "Please, enter the coordinates at which you want to draw a point."
msgstr "Asseblief, invoer die koördinate na wat jy wil hê na teken 'n punt."

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:295
msgid "*.kgeo"
msgstr "*.k-geo"

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:301
msgid "KGeo - Warning"
msgstr "K-geo - Waarskuwing"

#: kgeoMenuToolbarSlots.cpp:302
msgid ""
"The file already exists!\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to overwrite it? "
msgstr ""
"Die lêer alreeds bestaan!\n"
"\n"
"Doen jy wil hê na oorskryf dit? "

